---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Ways & Means — Expertise | R&R Communications"
  description="Media management, influencer management and crisis management — the three connections R&R Communications runs for Indonesia's most trusted brands."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="field"><canvas id="field"></canvas></div>
    <span class="ghostamp" aria-hidden="true">&amp;</span>
    <div class="wrap intro" style="padding-bottom:56px">
      <span class="kicker">Ways &amp; Means · expertise</span>
      <h1>Every connection,<br />professionally <i class="fancy-amp">&amp;</i> personally kept.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Three practices, one posture: we sit between you and the people who
      decide what you're worth — journalists, creators, and the public — and we keep that
      connection honest, warm, and working.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sect" style="padding-top:24px" id="media">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="xcards rv-stagger" style="margin-top:0">
        <div class="xcard" id="media-card">
          <span class="xamp" aria-hidden="true">&amp;</span>
          <h3>Brand <i class="fancy-amp">&amp;</i> Media</h3>
          <p>26 years of newsroom relationships, spent carefully.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Press release distribution</li>
            <li>Press conferences &amp; media gatherings</li>
            <li>Exclusive interviews &amp; desktop visits</li>
            <li>TV specials &amp; overseas junkets</li>
            <li>Editorial content outreach planning</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="xcard" id="creators">
          <span class="xamp" aria-hidden="true">&amp;</span>
          <h3>Brand <i class="fancy-amp">&amp;</i> Creators</h3>
          <p>40,000+ creator collaborations that sound like people.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Influencer mapping &amp; recommendation</li>
            <li>Initial approach &amp; continuous relations</li>
            <li>Campaign &amp; content management</li>
            <li>Content monitoring, analysis &amp; evaluation</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="xcard" id="crisis">
          <span class="xamp" aria-hidden="true">&amp;</span>
          <h3>Brand <i class="fancy-amp">&amp;</i> Crisis</h3>
          <p>When the story turns, the connection matters most.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Problem-based background analysis</li>
            <li>Strategy development</li>
            <li>Real-time response</li>
            <li>Solutions &amp; oversight</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band">
    <div class="wrap sect tight">
      <div class="rv">
        <span class="kicker">Tools &amp; Tech</span>
        <h2 class="display" style="font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,40px)">Instinct, backed by instruments</h2>
        <p class="lede">Wisdom is knowing what the numbers mean. We read them daily.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="toolsgrid rv-stagger">
        <div class="tool"><h3>Media monitoring</h3><p>Explicar · Binocular · Skema</p></div>
        <div class="tool"><h3>Social analytics</h3><p>Sprout Social · VidIQ · Brandwatch</p></div>
        <div class="tool"><h3>Content analytics</h3><p>Google Trends · Keyword Planner · SEMrush</p></div>
        <div class="tool"><h3>AI answer engines</h3><p>Our own multi-model visibility checker across ChatGPT, Gemini &amp; Claude</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ctaband">
    <span class="drift" aria-hidden="true">&amp;</span>
    <div class="wrap rv">
      <h2>Strategy is a promise.<br />Delivery is <i>proof</i>.</h2>
      <p>See what we have done, with the numbers attached.</p>
      <a class="btn teal" href="/said-and-done">Said &amp; Done <span class="bsub">— The Work</span> <span class="arr">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
